00:20:56.230 --> 00:21:00.230
All I ever wanted was for mankind to reach its highest potential.

00:21:00.230 --> 00:21:02.230
We're so close.

00:21:02.230 --> 00:21:05.230
And you betrayed me the very moment I needed you most.

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:08.230
