00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:27.779
So it's not a betrayal I should fear from you,

00:21:27.779 --> 00:21:29.779
just a simple lack of faith.

00:21:29.779 --> 00:21:34.119
I never doubt you, Lex.

00:21:34.119 --> 00:21:40.690
It's Milton fine.

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:41.690
Lex, what are you doing?

00:21:41.690 --> 00:21:43.690
He was following my orders.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:46.690
You disappoint me, Kara.

00:21:46.690 --> 00:21:50.690
With everything my family's done for you,

00:21:50.690 --> 00:21:52.690
to question my judgment.

00:21:52.690 --> 00:21:56.579
It's only because I care about you.

00:21:56.579 --> 00:22:03.359
Since the day my father found your ship submerged near Reeves' dam.

00:22:03.359 --> 00:22:05.359
Reeves' Dam.

00:22:05.359 --> 00:22:08.359
He loved you like you were his own daughter.

00:22:08.359 --> 00:22:11.359
He died, guarding your secret from the world.

00:22:11.359 --> 00:22:12.359
I know.

00:22:12.359 --> 00:22:14.359
And I owe my life to both of you.

00:22:14.359 --> 00:22:15.359
But this country...

00:22:15.359 --> 00:22:17.359
What do you know about protecting this country?

00:22:17.359 --> 00:22:19.359
You are an alien.

00:22:19.359 --> 00:22:22.359
I am the President of the United States of America.

00:22:22.359 --> 00:22:25.359
By striking the enemy first, I am ensuring our survival.

00:22:25.359 --> 00:22:28.359
We will prevail.

00:22:28.359 --> 00:22:30.359
And through it all, I expect you to...

00:22:30.359 --> 00:22:31.359
Look at me!

00:22:31.359 --> 00:22:32.359
I expect you to stand by my...

00:22:32.359 --> 00:22:37.750
you to stand by my side.

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:39.750
Of course, Mr. President.

00:22:39.750 --> 00:22:47.119
Sir, the press is gathering.

00:22:47.119 --> 00:22:49.119
You have two minutes.

00:22:49.119 --> 00:22:54.460
Great leaders are defined by the difficult decisions they make.

00:22:54.460 --> 00:23:05.619
Mr. President, history shall forever remember your name.

00:23:05.619 --> 00:23:27.329
This is a restricted area.

00:23:27.329 --> 00:23:28.329
Leave at once. Reporters are...

00:23:28.329 --> 00:23:29.329
Kara, listen to me.

00:23:29.329 --> 00:23:33.349
How do you know that name?

00:23:33.349 --> 00:23:36.349
Because I'm from Krypton. I'm your cousin.

00:23:36.349 --> 00:23:48.490
I'm Calell.

00:23:48.490 --> 00:23:50.490
I was sent here to kill you.

00:23:50.490 --> 00:23:57.609
I searched the globe and couldn't find you.

00:23:57.609 --> 00:23:58.609
you.

00:23:58.609 --> 00:24:01.609
Kall wasn't on the planet then, so how can you be here now?

00:24:01.609 --> 00:24:02.609
You're right.

00:24:02.609 --> 00:24:03.609
I never existed in this world.

00:24:03.609 --> 00:24:04.609
But somehow I'm here.

00:24:04.609 --> 00:24:06.609
Time was altered.

00:24:06.609 --> 00:24:07.609
Something went wrong.

00:24:07.609 --> 00:24:09.609
I can't explain what happened.

00:24:09.609 --> 00:24:10.609
But right now I need your help.

00:24:10.609 --> 00:24:13.609
We need to get the briefcase with the nuclear codes away from Lex.

00:24:13.609 --> 00:24:19.099
I trust Lex.

00:24:19.099 --> 00:24:23.099
And I'm going to stand by his side just like he's done for me all these years.

00:24:23.099 --> 00:24:26.099
Carol, Milton, fine, he's brainiac.

00:24:26.099 --> 00:24:34.119
He made it to Earth?

00:24:34.119 --> 00:24:36.119
It'll make sense. I should have seen it.

00:24:36.119 --> 00:24:37.119
He couldn't let you.

00:24:37.119 --> 00:24:44.059
If you knew his true identity, you would have kept him from his mission.

00:24:44.059 --> 00:24:47.059
Carried together, we can stop Brainiac once and for all.

00:24:47.059 --> 00:25:20.539
Who's this?

00:25:20.539 --> 00:25:24.539
He's from Krypton. Please just hear him out.

00:25:24.539 --> 00:25:27.539
Lex, think about how you got to this point in your life.

00:25:27.539 --> 00:25:30.539
And you'll see that Milton Fine was the one who led you here.

00:25:30.539 --> 00:25:33.539
Lex, you know it's the truth.

00:25:33.539 --> 00:25:35.539
He's manipulating you.

00:25:35.539 --> 00:25:38.539
His goal is to gain access to this country's nuclear arsenal.

00:25:38.539 --> 00:25:44.880
Sometimes things go so horribly wrong that the only way

00:25:44.880 --> 00:25:47.880
to fix them is by starting over.

00:25:47.880 --> 00:25:49.880
Is that what fine says?

00:25:49.880 --> 00:25:52.880
Lex, his goal is to destroy mankind.

00:25:52.880 --> 00:25:54.880
But not everyone.

00:25:54.880 --> 00:25:56.880
America's best and brightest are safe.

00:25:56.880 --> 00:25:59.880
They've already been shuttled to bunkers throughout the country.

00:25:59.880 --> 00:26:01.880
It doesn't make any sense.

00:26:01.880 --> 00:26:03.880
There'll mean nothing for them to come back to.

00:26:03.880 --> 00:26:05.880
When the dust settles, we'll rebuild.

00:26:05.880 --> 00:26:08.880
And I'll leave the survivors into a new world.

00:26:08.880 --> 00:26:41.359
Lex.

00:26:41.359 --> 00:26:45.359
I thought one day I might have to protect myself from you, Kara.

00:26:45.359 --> 00:26:48.359
I'm just sorry that day's finally here.

00:26:48.359 --> 00:26:55.440
You're supposed to be by my side forever.

00:26:55.440 --> 00:27:07.880
Take Ms. Danvers to the chopper and get her some medical attention.

00:27:07.880 --> 00:27:09.880
Keep her handcuffed at all times.

00:27:09.880 --> 00:27:19.480
Are you all right, Mr. President?

00:27:19.480 --> 00:27:24.799
Let's do it.

00:27:24.799 --> 00:27:26.799
Lex, don't do this.

00:27:26.799 --> 00:27:27.799
It's not too late.

00:27:27.799 --> 00:27:33.769
The future is yours, Mr. President.

00:27:33.769 --> 00:27:42.400
Don't do it, Lex.

00:27:42.400 --> 00:27:47.599
On my mark.

00:27:47.599 --> 00:27:48.599
No.

00:27:48.599 --> 00:27:49.599
Alpha, Fox Trot.

00:27:49.599 --> 00:27:50.599
Alpha.

00:27:50.599 --> 00:27:52.599
6404.

00:27:52.599 --> 00:27:54.599
Code confirmed.

00:27:54.599 --> 00:27:56.599
Stop! This is insane!

00:27:56.599 --> 00:27:59.599
Initiate launch.

00:27:59.599 --> 00:28:05.059
The team will assemble at the NORAD bunker, sir.

00:28:05.059 --> 00:28:07.059
I'll deal with the intruder.

00:28:07.059 --> 00:28:09.059
Security will meet you outside and take you to Air Force One.

00:28:09.059 --> 00:28:23.430
He will not keep me from the task I was programmed for.

00:28:23.430 --> 00:28:26.430
Zod is still alive.

00:28:26.430 --> 00:28:28.430
And trapped.

00:28:28.430 --> 00:28:31.430
In the Phantom Zone.

00:28:31.430 --> 00:28:33.430
With the humans gone, I'll use Karate,

00:28:33.430 --> 00:28:35.430
them through her fortress.

00:28:35.430 --> 00:28:38.430
She'll never go along with it.

00:28:38.430 --> 00:28:44.210
Didn't look like she had much fight left in her.

00:28:44.210 --> 00:28:46.210
But she'll heal. She's healthy.

00:28:46.210 --> 00:28:52.750
And so is Lex Luthor, the vessel.

00:28:52.750 --> 00:28:56.750
Together they will repopulate the planet.

00:28:56.750 --> 00:29:10.539
And Krypton will rise again.

00:29:10.539 --> 00:29:20.299
You cannot change the course of history, Kallel.

00:29:20.299 --> 00:29:22.299
You disappoint me, my son.

00:29:22.299 --> 00:29:26.299
You cannot question your destiny on this planet.

00:29:26.299 --> 00:29:28.299
It was you!

00:29:28.299 --> 00:29:33.190
I wanted to show me what the world would be like if I wasn't here!

00:29:33.190 --> 00:29:37.190
The disc in your hand revealed your misguided intentions.

00:29:37.190 --> 00:29:41.190
I was forced to show you the error of your ways.

00:29:41.190 --> 00:29:45.190
I sent you to Earth for a purpose, Kala.

00:29:45.190 --> 00:29:48.190
One that cannot be taken like you.

00:29:48.190 --> 00:29:50.190
Send me back!

00:29:50.190 --> 00:29:54.170
You must stop the brain interactive construct for

00:29:54.190 --> 00:29:59.190
from altering history and taking your life.

00:29:59.190 --> 00:30:01.190
You cannot fail.

00:30:01.190 --> 00:30:06.190
This time, there will be no second chances.

00:30:06.190 --> 00:30:10.009
Clark, what happened?

00:30:10.009 --> 00:30:14.990
I thought you were gone forever.

00:30:14.990 --> 00:30:16.990
And then a millisecond later, you're perfectly fine.

00:30:16.990 --> 00:30:17.990
Chloe.

00:30:17.990 --> 00:30:22.240
There's still time. I have to make it right.

00:30:22.240 --> 00:30:41.039
I have to go to Krypton.

00:30:41.039 --> 00:30:42.039
Gosh, Kalal.

00:30:42.039 --> 00:30:48.059
It's time to sleep.

00:30:48.059 --> 00:30:56.720
Every boy goes up to be a hero.

00:30:56.720 --> 00:31:18.859
He'll die on Krypton.

00:31:18.859 --> 00:31:21.859
And now you will share his bait.

00:31:21.859 --> 00:31:24.809
We'll let that happen.

00:31:24.809 --> 00:31:32.349
We're gonna release love.

00:31:32.349 --> 00:31:38.890
You can't stop me.

00:31:38.890 --> 00:31:39.890
Callow.

00:31:39.890 --> 00:31:42.880
The baby.

00:31:42.880 --> 00:31:53.880
There's no yellow sun to charge you, here.

00:31:53.880 --> 00:32:04.000
Not in Kansas anymore.

00:32:04.000 --> 00:32:13.829
I'll be on the ship now before it's too late.

00:32:13.829 --> 00:34:10.360
Please let me know the minute anything changes.

00:34:10.360 --> 00:34:14.369
The nurse says,

00:34:14.369 --> 00:34:18.289
Lana seems worse than ever.

00:34:18.289 --> 00:34:22.239
I know I destroyed Brainiac.

00:34:22.239 --> 00:34:25.239
I thought if he died, it would break his grip over Lana,

00:34:25.239 --> 00:34:26.239
but I was wrong.

00:34:26.239 --> 00:34:33.400
I don't know what else to do.

00:34:33.400 --> 00:34:38.079
I'm so sorry.

00:34:38.079 --> 00:34:40.079
You know, maybe if we reopen the portal to Krypton.

00:34:40.079 --> 00:34:42.079
We can't.

00:34:42.079 --> 00:34:45.079
As much as I want Lana well again, there's no going back.

00:34:45.079 --> 00:34:48.079
But if we go back, there's so much more we could do.

00:34:48.079 --> 00:34:50.079
We could save our home.

00:34:50.079 --> 00:34:54.809
You don't know how many times I wish I could have done that.

00:34:54.809 --> 00:34:56.809
But you know, it's possible.

00:34:56.809 --> 00:35:01.809
If we just find the right point in time, we can fix everything.

00:35:01.809 --> 00:35:04.809
But how do we know we won't make it worse?

00:35:04.809 --> 00:35:13.829
We can't change the past care. We can only affect the future.

00:35:13.829 --> 00:35:23.139
Whatever that future is, I want you to know that I'll always be there.

00:35:23.139 --> 00:35:37.110
I'm here for you.

00:35:37.110 --> 00:35:57.679
This place hasn't changed a bit since I last saw it.

00:35:57.679 --> 00:35:59.679
What are you doing here?

00:35:59.679 --> 00:36:06.719
You were the last person to see Lana while she was well.

00:36:06.719 --> 00:36:09.719
I figured you're the one to talk to if I have any chance of helping her.

00:36:09.719 --> 00:36:14.519
of helping her.

00:36:14.519 --> 00:36:16.519
No one's asking for your help.

00:36:16.519 --> 00:36:18.519
I'm only trying to save her, Clark.

00:36:18.519 --> 00:36:28.320
I had the best medical minds in the world examine her.

00:36:28.320 --> 00:36:31.320
Is there anything the doctors can do to help her?

00:36:31.320 --> 00:36:34.320
They tell me her condition is unlike any of they've ever seen.

00:36:34.320 --> 00:36:41.489
Several specialists described it as almost alien.

00:36:41.489 --> 00:36:49.039
So you tell me the best doctors in the world can't do anything to help Lana?

00:36:49.039 --> 00:36:54.480
Unfortunately, they've all come to the same conclusion.

00:36:54.480 --> 00:36:58.840
Her state is irreversible.

00:36:58.840 --> 00:36:59.840
That's why I came to you, Clark.

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:02.840
If we could find out what triggered Lana syndrome,

00:37:02.840 --> 00:37:10.059
maybe we could have hope.

00:37:10.059 --> 00:37:11.059
Think, Clark.

00:37:11.059 --> 00:37:15.559
She was living with you.

00:37:15.559 --> 00:37:17.559
Is there anything you can remember

00:37:17.559 --> 00:37:19.559
that might explain how this could have happened?

00:37:19.559 --> 00:37:39.260
I wish there was.

00:37:39.260 --> 00:37:42.260
If there's something you left out that you'd like to share,

00:37:42.260 --> 00:37:44.260
you know where to find me.

00:37:44.260 --> 00:38:08.690
This is a new side to Clark Kent,

00:38:08.690 --> 00:38:11.690
a mild-mannered reporter for a great metropolitan newspaper.

00:38:11.690 --> 00:38:13.690
Don't worry, Lois, I'm not after your job.

00:38:13.690 --> 00:38:15.690
Just borrowing the planet's database.

00:38:15.690 --> 00:38:17.690
Jimmy set me up here. I hope it's okay.

00:38:17.690 --> 00:38:20.690
Hey, me, desktop, ACD, desktop.

00:38:20.690 --> 00:38:22.690
What are you looking up?

00:38:22.690 --> 00:38:32.679
I'm no expert, but I'm sure that someone's out there who can help, Lana.

00:38:32.679 --> 00:38:40.579
You know, with all my years of watching Dr. Phil, you think I could come up with a perfect thing to say,

00:38:40.579 --> 00:38:43.579
but, uh, I'm drawing a blank.

00:38:43.579 --> 00:38:46.579
I don't do well with sad.

00:38:46.579 --> 00:38:53.550
Don't beat yourself up over at Lois.

00:38:53.550 --> 00:38:55.550
It's okay.

00:38:55.550 --> 00:38:58.550
No, it's not.

00:38:58.550 --> 00:38:59.550
Smallville, you were there.

00:38:59.550 --> 00:39:03.550
there for me when I needed a shoulder to cry on, and I am blowing this big time.

00:39:03.550 --> 00:39:09.150
Look, I, I just wish I could make everything all right.

00:39:09.150 --> 00:39:21.130
You're a good friend, Lois.

00:39:21.130 --> 00:39:25.130
Hey, you know what? Why don't we, um, go drown in sorrows?

00:39:25.130 --> 00:39:27.130
Why don't I buy you a brew?

00:39:27.130 --> 00:39:29.130
You look like you could use one?

00:39:29.130 --> 00:39:32.989
Seriously, check out your driver's license.

00:39:32.989 --> 00:39:34.989
We're legal now.

00:39:34.989 --> 00:39:36.989
I'm not really into the whole nightlife scene.

00:39:36.989 --> 00:39:38.989
Well, I will have to take that as a challenge.

00:39:38.989 --> 00:39:40.989
First round is on me.

